NOTES=[('small-worlds','The wild, at another scale.',P('555826408'),'A small reptile, a warm stone, an entire world of detail.','Look closely at the supplied reptile photographs and the landscape changes scale. Texture takes the place of a wide horizon; a small movement becomes the centre of the image. These frames offer a quieter way into the wildlife archive.','Wildlife'),('a-line-of-blue','A line of blue.',P('526215548'),'Reading the coast through colour, rock and water.','From above, the shoreline is a drawing in colour. Pale stone meets turquoise shallows before giving way to deeper blue. The supplied coastal photographs let the shape of the shore carry the story.','Landscapes'),('behind-the-frame','On the other side of the frame.',P('526285315'),'The image begins before the shutter.','The archive includes photographs of the process itself: a camera raised, a figure watching, equipment in the field. They bring a human presence to the finished image without inventing the circumstances of a particular shoot.','Behind the Lens')]
